[38;5;10m1 A / 7 A / 3[0m makes C print the tcache [38;5;10mnext[0m field where the city name was, which is [38;5;10mchunk_address >> 12[0m — so the C program disagrees with [1mitself[22m run to run under ASLR. Rather than skipping those inputs, the randomized sweeps detect them by running C twice and still require stderr and exit status to match exactly; [38;5;10mfreed_name_reads_are_not_reproducible_in_c[0m pins down that the Rust output matches all 24 C runs apart from 1–8 bytes in the name field. [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m documents this plus two deeper limitations ([38;5;10mfind_shortest_path[0m's own [38;5;10mmalloc[0m, and glibc diagnostics chosen by garbage metadata) with runnable reproducers.[0m[0m
